{"id":"1a4ba10013f4fc82","group":"43","path":"43/43-df-formula.md","title":"公式的有限阶段构造","display":"df-formula — 公式的有限阶段构造","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Algorithmic Randomness and Complexity","book_abbrev":"43","label":"43-df-formula","aliases":["43-df-formula"],"display":"df-formula — 公式的有限阶段构造","depends_on":["[[43-df-atomic-formula]]","[[43-df-variable]]"],"source_edition":"Downey–Hirschfeldt, draft 2007-07-28","source_location":"本目录内建一阶逻辑语法/语义支撑；原书仅预设通常逻辑，未定位到独立对应条目","source_scope":"local-support","verification_status":"formalization-reviewed","source_proof_checked":false},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Algorithmic Randomness and Complexity"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"43"},{"key":"label","html":"43-df-formula"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>43-df-formula</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-formula — 公式的有限阶段构造"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"f36fa03fda24ed88\" href=\"?note=f36fa03fda24ed88\" title=\"43-df-atomic-formula\">43-df-atomic-formula</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"d30a215bc9db4b5d\" href=\"?note=d30a215bc9db4b5d\" title=\"43-df-variable\">43-df-variable</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_edition","html":"Downey–Hirschfeldt, draft 2007-07-28"},{"key":"source_location","html":"本目录内建一阶逻辑语法/语义支撑；原书仅预设通常逻辑，未定位到独立对应条目"},{"key":"source_scope","html":"local-support"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"formalization-reviewed"},{"key":"source_proof_checked","html":"false"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L\\in\\operatorname{Lang}_1\">\\(L\\in\\operatorname{Lang}_1\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x\\in\\operatorname{Var}\">\\(x\\in\\operatorname{Var}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varphi,\\psi\">\\(\\varphi,\\psi\\)</span> 为候选公式对象；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"m\\in\\mathbb N\">\\(m\\in\\mathbb N\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{AtFml}_L\">\\(\\operatorname{AtFml}_L\\)</span> 采用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"f36fa03fda24ed88\" href=\"?note=f36fa03fda24ed88\" title=\"43-df-atomic-formula\">43-df-atomic-formula</a>。对象层连接词与量词记法是下式编码的别名。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Neg}(\\varphi):=(7,\\varphi),\\quad\\operatorname{And}(\\varphi,\\psi):=(8,(\\varphi,\\psi)),\\quad\\operatorname{Or}(\\varphi,\\psi):=(9,(\\varphi,\\psi)),\\quad\\operatorname{Imp}(\\varphi,\\psi):=(10,(\\varphi,\\psi)).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Neg}(\\varphi):=(7,\\varphi),\\quad\\operatorname{And}(\\varphi,\\psi):=(8,(\\varphi,\\psi)),\\quad\\operatorname{Or}(\\varphi,\\psi):=(9,(\\varphi,\\psi)),\\quad\\operatorname{Imp}(\\varphi,\\psi):=(10,(\\varphi,\\psi)).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{All}(x,\\varphi):=(11,(x,\\varphi)),\\qquad\\operatorname{Ex}(x,\\varphi):=(12,(x,\\varphi)).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{All}(x,\\varphi):=(11,(x,\\varphi)),\\qquad\\operatorname{Ex}(x,\\varphi):=(12,(x,\\varphi)).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\neg\\varphi:=\\operatorname{Neg}(\\varphi),\\quad(\\varphi\\land\\psi):=\\operatorname{And}(\\varphi,\\psi),\\quad(\\varphi\\lor\\psi):=\\operatorname{Or}(\\varphi,\\psi),\\quad(\\varphi\\to\\psi):=\\operatorname{Imp}(\\varphi,\\psi),\\quad\\forall x\\varphi:=\\operatorname{All}(x,\\varphi),\\quad\\exists x\\varphi:=\\operatorname{Ex}(x,\\varphi).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\neg\\varphi:=\\operatorname{Neg}(\\varphi),\\quad(\\varphi\\land\\psi):=\\operatorname{And}(\\varphi,\\psi),\\quad(\\varphi\\lor\\psi):=\\operatorname{Or}(\\varphi,\\psi),\\quad(\\varphi\\to\\psi):=\\operatorname{Imp}(\\varphi,\\psi),\\quad\\forall x\\varphi:=\\operatorname{All}(x,\\varphi),\\quad\\exists x\\varphi:=\\operatorname{Ex}(x,\\varphi).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"F_{L,0}:=\\operatorname{AtFml}_L.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[F_{L,0}:=\\operatorname{AtFml}_L.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"F_{L,m+1}:=F_{L,m}\\cup\\{\\operatorname{Neg}(\\varphi):\\varphi\\in F_{L,m}\\}\\cup\\{\\operatorname{And}(\\varphi,\\psi):\\varphi,\\psi\\in F_{L,m}\\}\\cup\\{\\operatorname{Or}(\\varphi,\\psi):\\varphi,\\psi\\in F_{L,m}\\}\\cup\\{\\operatorname{Imp}(\\varphi,\\psi):\\varphi,\\psi\\in F_{L,m}\\}\\cup\\{\\operatorname{All}(x,\\varphi):x\\in\\operatorname{Var},\\ \\varphi\\in F_{L,m}\\}\\cup\\{\\operatorname{Ex}(x,\\varphi):x\\in\\operatorname{Var},\\ \\varphi\\in F_{L,m}\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[F_{L,m+1}:=F_{L,m}\\cup\\{\\operatorname{Neg}(\\varphi):\\varphi\\in F_{L,m}\\}\\cup\\{\\operatorname{And}(\\varphi,\\psi):\\varphi,\\psi\\in F_{L,m}\\}\\cup\\{\\operatorname{Or}(\\varphi,\\psi):\\varphi,\\psi\\in F_{L,m}\\}\\cup\\{\\operatorname{Imp}(\\varphi,\\psi):\\varphi,\\psi\\in F_{L,m}\\}\\cup\\{\\operatorname{All}(x,\\varphi):x\\in\\operatorname{Var},\\ \\varphi\\in F_{L,m}\\}\\cup\\{\\operatorname{Ex}(x,\\varphi):x\\in\\operatorname{Var},\\ \\varphi\\in F_{L,m}\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Fml}_L:=\\bigcup_{m\\in\\mathbb N}F_{L,m}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Fml}_L:=\\bigcup_{m\\in\\mathbb N}F_{L,m}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>每种构造使用不同标签，参数由有序对唯一恢复。所有公式在有限阶段生成，因而结构递归具有唯一值；元语言中的量词不参与对象公式编码。</p>\n<p>来源定位沿用附件：本目录内建一阶逻辑语法/语义支撑；原书仅预设通常逻辑，未定位到独立对应条目。本轮核查形式化的内部一致性；未重新核对原书完整证明。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"43-df-atomic-formula","status":"resolved","id":"f36fa03fda24ed88","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[43-df-atomic-formula]]","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-variable","status":"resolved","id":"d30a215bc9db4b5d","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[43-df-variable]]","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-atomic-formula","status":"resolved","id":"f36fa03fda24ed88","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$L\\in\\operatorname{Lang}_1$；$x\\in\\operatorname{Var}$，$\\varphi,\\psi$ 为候选公式对象；$m\\in\\mathbb N$。$\\operatorname{AtFml}_L$ 采用 [[43-df-atomic-formula]]。对象层连接词与量词记法是下式编码的别名。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"L\\in\\operatorname{Lang}_1","display":false},{"tex":"x\\in\\operatorname{Var}","display":false},{"tex":"\\varphi,\\psi","display":false},{"tex":"m\\in\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{AtFml}_L","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Neg}(\\varphi):=(7,\\varphi),\\quad\\operatorname{And}(\\varphi,\\psi):=(8,(\\varphi,\\psi)),\\quad\\operatorname{Or}(\\varphi,\\psi):=(9,(\\varphi,\\psi)),\\quad\\operatorname{Imp}(\\varphi,\\psi):=(10,(\\varphi,\\psi)).","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{All}(x,\\varphi):=(11,(x,\\varphi)),\\qquad\\operatorname{Ex}(x,\\varphi):=(12,(x,\\varphi)).","display":true},{"tex":"\\neg\\varphi:=\\operatorname{Neg}(\\varphi),\\quad(\\varphi\\land\\psi):=\\operatorname{And}(\\varphi,\\psi),\\quad(\\varphi\\lor\\psi):=\\operatorname{Or}(\\varphi,\\psi),\\quad(\\varphi\\to\\psi):=\\operatorname{Imp}(\\varphi,\\psi),\\quad\\forall x\\varphi:=\\operatorname{All}(x,\\varphi),\\quad\\exists x\\varphi:=\\operatorname{Ex}(x,\\varphi).","display":true},{"tex":"F_{L,0}:=\\operatorname{AtFml}_L.","display":true},{"tex":"F_{L,m+1}:=F_{L,m}\\cup\\{\\operatorname{Neg}(\\varphi):\\varphi\\in F_{L,m}\\}\\cup\\{\\operatorname{And}(\\varphi,\\psi):\\varphi,\\psi\\in F_{L,m}\\}\\cup\\{\\operatorname{Or}(\\varphi,\\psi):\\varphi,\\psi\\in F_{L,m}\\}\\cup\\{\\operatorname{Imp}(\\varphi,\\psi):\\varphi,\\psi\\in F_{L,m}\\}\\cup\\{\\operatorname{All}(x,\\varphi):x\\in\\operatorname{Var},\\ \\varphi\\in F_{L,m}\\}\\cup\\{\\operatorname{Ex}(x,\\varphi):x\\in\\operatorname{Var},\\ \\varphi\\in F_{L,m}\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Fml}_L:=\\bigcup_{m\\in\\mathbb N}F_{L,m}.","display":true}],"bytes":2448,"backlinks":[{"id":"16154750d33f58cc","anchor":"ref-7","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$L\\in\\operatorname{Lang}_1$，$x\\in\\operatorname{Var}$、$c\\in L_{\\rm Const}$、$n\\in\\mathbb N_{\\ge1}$、$f\\in L_{\\rm Func,n}$、$R\\in L_{\\rm Rel,n}$；$t,u,t_i\\in\\operatorname{Term}_L$，$\\varphi,\\psi\\in\\operatorname{Fml}_L$。构造函数采用 [[43-df-term]]、[[43-df-atomic-formula]]、[[43-df-formula]]；以下沿有限语法树递归。"},{"id":"3238d7fca6c27a3f","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"1be181e56e937ecb","anchor":"ref-1","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"f5b5175508d7a1c1","anchor":"ref-490","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[43-df-formula]] — 公式的有限阶段构造"}],"outgoing":["f36fa03fda24ed88","d30a215bc9db4b5d"]}